[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752677276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104626#issuecomment-2752677276","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104626","id":2752677276,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kEoWc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T22:19:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T22:23:23Z","body":"This is expected, changing scale changes the font oversampling and old glyph images are cleared, so you do need to redraw in this case. Window will send `queue_redraw` to all nodes, but since you are not using `_draw()` to draw (which is intended place to draw) it won't do anything. And this is not the only case when redraw is needed.\n\nCorrect way to draw is something like this. Note that `_draw` will be only called if it's necessary to redraw, or you called `queue_redraw`, not every frame:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready():\n\ttext_rid = RenderingServer.canvas_item_create()\n\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_parent(text_rid, get_canvas_item())\n\ttext_line.add_string(\"Hello World!\", ThemeDB.fallback_font, 32)\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_clear(text_rid)\n\ttext_line.draw(text_rid, Vector2.ZERO)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752677276/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756163418","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104626#issuecomment-2756163418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104626","id":2756163418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kR7da","user":{"login":"Decapitated","id":12834552,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODM0NTUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12834552?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated","html_url":"https://github.com/Decapitated","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Decapitated/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T01:13:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T01:14:12Z","body":"@bruvzg Is there any more granular way to know when the glyphs have been cleared? There are times when the `TextLine` doesn't need to be redrawn, but `_draw()` is still called. Also, something in the docs saying that the glyphs could be cleared and need redrawing would be nice.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756163418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756907995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104626#issuecomment-2756907995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104626","id":2756907995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kUxPb","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T06:42:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T06:42:58Z","body":"> Is there any more granular way to know when the glyphs have been cleared?\n\nNo, `TextLine` do some checks internally and won't do full text processing if it's not necessary.\nIn general if `_draw()` is called you should always redraw, it's not text specific.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756907995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]